{"4":[{"k":"h","t":"3. HOW TO PLAY THIS GAME"},{"k":"p","t":"(1)"},{"k":"p","t":"(2)"},{"k":"p","t":"(3)"},{"k":"p","t":"(4)"},{"k":"p","t":"(5) Insert a coin(s) and press either 1-or 2-PLAYER BUTTON."},{"k":"p","t":"Turn the right-hand ball to adjust the sight (_ =|- _) at the enemy missile, and by pressing the FIRE BUTTON destroy the enemy \u2014 you can score points."},{"k":"p","t":"Once the FIRE BUTTON has been pressed, the sigh mark ( ae ) remains at the same position even when the sight has been moved \u2014 your missile will reach the position flying to destroy the enemy missile."},{"k":"p","t":"When all the enemy missiles have been destroyed, the game proceeds to the next round."},{"k":"p","t":"When all of your fighters have been destroyed, the game is over."},{"k":"li","t":"* Scoring 10,000 points (or 30,000 points when the DIP SW3 is turned ON) awards another fighter."},{"k":"li","t":"* Each time when 4 rounds have been completed, you are awarded an EXTRA GAME as a bonus."},{"k":"p","t":"<EXTRA GAME> e The ground surface disappears, and meteorites and the enemy fighters will come to assault your position. Destroy them by launching your missiles. @ When your fighter(s) remain understroyed, you are awarded another fighter. e@ The farther the meteorite or the enemy fighter away from your fighter, the more points you can score when destroying any of them \u2014 you are awarded points between 300 and 1,000. @ When the EXTRA GAME is over, the game returns to the starting mode."},{"k":"p","t":"~~ SCORE \u2014"},{"k":"h","t":"Enemy Missile Enemy Mother Ship bom on oe"},{"k":"tr","t":"Ww XK   O\u00a9OO   se   v"},{"k":"tr","t":"No. 1   No. 2   No. 3   No. 4   No.5 |   300 pts plus   5 pt"},{"k":"tr","t":"Opts. | 20 pts. | 30 pts. | 40 pts. | 50 pts. |   10 missiles   pts."},{"k":"p","t":"XM"},{"k":"p","t":"Bonus Points at Each Round"},{"k":"li","t":"* Per your undestroyed missile ......... 5 pts"},{"k":"li","t":"* Per your undestroyed fighter ......... 100 pts x No